# Component organisation review

Keep one main guide for each shared behaviour, retain useful variants and preserve every published URL. The catalogue now uses the shared owners below. Related guides link to their owner and retain their own source context, complete examples and stable URL.

The baseline contains **147 guides and 263 examples**, including **68 component pages**: 57 in the main component section and 11 in the publishing section. The new brand and writing chapters are additional review standards, not retroactive additions to that baseline. The [whole-system audit](design-system-audit.html) records the wider final review.

<% audit = JSON.parse(File.read(File.join(root, 'data', 'component-rationalisation.json'))) %>
