## Review evidence and limits

This requirements and taxonomy review read the existing guides, their example references and the maintained runtime modules. It then checked the proposals against **33 frozen brand rules and 68 frozen writing rules**. The organisation record stores the rule-file hashes and relevant rule dependencies for each proposal. Separate reviewers assess actual component and example compliance in the [whole-system audit](design-system-audit.html).

The [audit checklist](../reference/component-audit-checklist.json) records five repeatable loops: inventory; requirements; frozen-rule review; URL-preserving proposals; evidence and handoff. Repeat the affected loop when a source, component, rule or coverage claim changes.

The original taxonomy review was a source inspection. The subsequent implementation adds canonical guidance and family navigation, with build and rendered-browser evidence recorded in the [work package](guidance-work-package.html). Native assistive-technology use and physical device acceptance remain separate checks.
